            "Ore is a systems language "
            <em>
              "without"
            " garbage collection.\n  Memory comes from explicit "
            <code>
              "Allocator"
            " values.\n  "
          <h2>
            "Why another language?"
          "\n  "
          <ol>
            "\n    "
            <li>
              "Errors are values.\n    "
            <li>
              "Enums are tagged unions.\n    "
            <li>
              "No hidden allocation.\n  "
          "\n  "
